    "title": "Jury finds Melendez guilty of all counts in murder trial - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By 7 News Staff ,\n12 hours ago WATERTOWN, New York (WWNY) - The murder trial of Jonathan Melendez is over, with jurors unanimously deciding he’s guilty on all counts. The trial surrounded the death of 88-year-old Rena Eves, whom Melendez has now been convicted of killing with a hammer in her town of Watertown apartment during the summer of 2023. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
